WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:14,820
The closer the bulb is, the better, but like you're saying you had it on your headboard.

00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:22,820
Like, but we don't have it on our headboard. It comes up underneath our headboard and it lies.

00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:29,820
It was lying right next to us. So you want it, you want it close to you.

00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:42,820
So if you are, if you are at a state where your cancer is at a good state of remission and your husband is wanting to get some therapy too.

00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:48,820
If it was 12 inches away from you and 12 inches away from your husband, that's fine.

00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:53,820
18 inches, two feet away from each of you, you're both getting adequate treatment.

00:00:53,820 --> 00:01:02,820
If you're in the middle of a more serious state of your cancer, you want to be snuggling with that thing.

00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:03,820
Okay.

